      "id": "claim_93144164231c422d91ca0724b3c4258b",
      "statement": "Caelundas is a NestJS CLI application that computes planetary positions via Swiss Ephemeris (JPL DE431), detects astronomical events in two passes (perfective and progressive), stores them in Postgres, and renders .ics and JSON calendar files.",
