      "statement": "Event detection runs in two passes: PerfectiveService scans minute-by-minute for exact moments (aspects perfecting, stations, ingresses, eclipse maxima, phase crossings, twilight boundaries); ProgressiveService pairs forming/dissolving or begin/end boundaries from perfective events into duration spans (aspect orbs, retrograde periods, eclipse spans, sign dwell times, phase spans, daylight/twilight/night spans).",
